{"id":"masaje","lemma":"masaje","pos":"noun","rank":3080,"glosses":["massage"],"ipa":"/maˈsaxe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"masajes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-masaje.wav","examples":[{"text":"Necesito un masaje.","en":"I need a massage.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442648","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ella le dio un masaje.","en":"She gave him a massage.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639426","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Quiero un masaje, lo necesito para relajarme.","en":"I want a massage. I need to relax.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to relax, to loosen","l":"relajar"}]},{"text":"Tom le pidió a Mary que le diera un masaje, pero ella no quería.","en":"Tom asked Mary to give him a massage, but she didn't want to.","words":[null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to ask for something","l":"pedir"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"}]}]}